=head1 DESCRIPTION

Exceptions to the risk evaluation configuration, including always-allow
and always-block IP address ranges.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 BlockedIPRangeList => ArrayRef[Str|Undef]

An always-block IP address list. Overrides the risk decision and always
blocks authentication requests. This parameter is displayed and set in
CIDR notation.


=head2 SkippedIPRangeList => ArrayRef[Str|Undef]

An always-allow IP address list. Risk detection isn't performed on the
IP addresses in this range list. This parameter is displayed and set in
CIDR notation.



